{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01PvLENbkS7svtjhqYDVd8eM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Anchor R&D Surface v7 â€” \"Integrated Board\" â€” Planning Trio Summary\n\n**Goal / North Star (locked from John's Stage-0 answers)**\n- Make the project board an **honest, integrated, well-summarized view of all work** â€” three pillars: short+clean summaries, live sessions in their lane columns, and every session summarized on finish.\n- **Short, clean summaries:** every *displayed short* summary (project objective line, per-tile blurb) is length-capped and scrubbed of markdown/decorative glyphs (`**`, `â€”`, `##`, backticks, the `âœ“` greeting). Full markdown stays only on the dedicated `/summary` page.\n- **Live sessions live in their lane column:** a session started in research/plan/build/deliverables appears as a tile in its lane column the moment it starts (green = running) and stays there when done.\n\n**Locked decisions (Stage-0 user gates)**\n- **#1 â€” short + clean (decided):** add a plain-text normalizer that strips markdown + decorative glyphs from any *short displayed* summary and caps length (objective â‰ˆ 1 sentence; per-tile blurb ~8â€“12 words). Keep generate-twice + grounding. Full markdown only on `/summary`.\n- **#2 â€” Option B (approved):** session tiles in BOTH places â€” the top active strip stays for currently-running sessions, AND every session appears as a lane-column tile on start and persists when done (newest prominent, older under an openable \"previous sessions\" expander, the v6 pattern).\n- **#3:** summarize each session when it finishes.\n- **#4:** the \"Open terminal\" general session = a bare lane (NOT a board column).\n\n**Scope / approach**\n- v7 **EXTENDS existing v4/v5/v6 seams â€” no new modules** â€” delivered over **5 waves**.\n- Frozen design in `planning/rnd-v7/MASTER-PLAN.md`; build plan in `planning/rnd-v7/IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN.md`; approved board mockup in `planning/rnd-v7/_mockups/board_integration.html`.\n\n**Wave breakdown (the implementation plan)**\n- **Wave 1 â€” short/clean summaries (`summarizer.py`):** `short_summary_text(..., max_chars=140)` and tighter `tile_blurb(...)` (~64-char cap) â€” strip markdown control sequences + a decorative-glyph set, collapse whitespace, cap on a word boundary; applied only at short display sites, leaving full markdown untouched.\n- **Wave 2 â€” summarize-on-finish (`anchor_gui._trigger_session_summary_on_finish` + `summarizer.session_blurb`):** background daemon-thread generation on terminal transitions (`term_kill` / `finish_to_build` / `reconcile_and_advance`) â€” non-blocking, idempotent, never poisons cache on failure; `session_blurb` returns the short/clean one-liner or honest `\"\"`.\n- **Wave 3 â€” live sessions in lane columns (`_gather_project_sessions` + `_merge_registry_sessions`):** bridge live `session_registry` sessions (SAFE projection) merged with effort-history sessions, **deduped by `session_id`**, newest-first; `general`/`grass` excluded from trio columns; render stays cache/registry-only (no model call).\n- **Wave 4 â€” \"Open terminal\" general session (`terminal_session.py`):** bare `general` lane (not in `LANE_SKILL` â†’ no skill seed), Claude/Gemini toggle, valid lane but excluded from board columns and auto-advance chain.\n- **Wave 5 â€” CLI mirror + healthcheck + distro + docs (PROJECT DONE):** `anchor.py rnd blurb` read-only mirror; `check_rnd_v7_surface` fully stubbed (stub PTY + stream-json stub runner + temp worktree base, never binds `:8777`); distro import scan stays clean (only the declared `pywinpty` exception; Playwright DEV-only).\n\n**Verification standard (non-negotiable, the v4 lesson)**\n- Every UI wave (3â€“4) requires rendered-DOM assertions (positive + negative) + a real Playwright + Chromium interaction test + an orchestrator screenshot checked against the rnd-v7 mockup + John's sign-off before merge. A string-grep-only test is an automatic wave HALT.\n\n**Outcome (per the Execution Log)**\n- **BUILT by Foreman, all 5 waves, on branch `foreman/rnd-surface-v7`** (off master, which had v6 merged); status GREEN (888 passed).\n- **Merged + pushed to master** (merge `80ead40`) on 2026-06-15. Service restart (`nssm restart anchor`, elevated) + rescan still needed to deploy live.\n\n---\n*Note: this summary is grounded in the supplied anchors plus the v7 records in `CLAUDE.md`/memory. I did not re-read the three member docs directly â€” if you want a summary derived strictly from the file contents of `planning/rnd-v7/{MASTER-PLAN,IMPLEMENTATION-PLAN,EXECUTION-LOG}.md`, say the word and I'll read and ground against them.*"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4412,"cache_creation_input_tokens":38479,"cache_read_input_tokens":20597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":38479},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0b369d4c-c165-456a-b7f4-f62ae9a9f16c","uuid":"91309e1d-25c3-4482-b5d1-df226a04a002","request_id":"req_011Cc5ayAQRSRsTsSR8HGtgM"}
